Prohibited:

Realistic commercial photography, movie poster feel, advertising models, 3D rendering, 3D text, glass material, metallic texture, neon lights, cyberpunk, soft gradients, heavy shadows, lens flares, dreamy light effects, cartoon illustrations, cute style, children's picture book style, anime style, minimalist Logo posters, corporate brochures, templated infographics, centered symmetrical composition, full-bleed photos, excessive vintage, severely yellowed, rich colors, meaningless decorations, cluttered graffiti, low-resolution sketches, crude AI gibberish, directly copying reference works.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
XI. Final Output Requirements
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Output a highly completed vertical experimental magazine cover or cultural poster.

The visual must include:

